			"date": "2026-09-17T23:19:31.431Z",
			"content": "<p>Curious if you thought about inlining the SVGs (instead of `&lt;wa-icon&gt;`) and using `&lt;use&gt;` for all of the stars. For a server-rendered product search page where dozens of star ratings could appear, I think it saved a lot of bytes and runtime operations.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
