			"date": "2026-09-18T00:09:27.080Z",
			"content": "<p>Missed a detail, I meant to say that *we* used &lt;use&gt; in our rating component.</p>\n<p>Yup, I know about the cache! Problem we had (when we used a similar icon web component) was that each rating was including 5 additional shadow roots and custom elements that needed to initialize.</p>",
